message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "ExamAgent NDE"
version: "2.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-19"
authors:
  - family-names: "Gonzalez"
    given-names: "Oscar"
    affiliation: "Universidad (por confirmar)"
abstract: >-
  A locally hosted, browser-driven system for AI-assisted grading on closed
  assessment platforms. Uses a cascaded multi-model architecture with a fast
  tier for closed-ended questions, an arbitration tier for open-ended and
  disputed items, and a fail-closed publish loop with per-item verification.
keywords:
  - computing education
  - large language models
  - formative assessment
  - browser automation
  - local inference
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/<usuario>/examagent-nde"
